# Integrity harness dataset + fixtures are source-of-record and MUST be tracked
# (they are pulled dataset annotations / predicate specs / decision records, not scan
# output). Their *generated* run artifacts (result JSON, provenance ledgers) are not.
!integrity_harness/data/*.json
integrity_harness/reports/*_result.json
integrity_harness/reports/*.jsonl
